    "answer": {
      "short": "$7$ and $35$.\n\nRepresent the numbers by $x$ and $5x$.",
      "worked": "Let the smaller number be $x$. The other number is $5x$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}x+5x&=42\\\\6x&=42\\\\x&=7\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe other number is $5\\times7=35$.\n\nCheck: $7+35=42$ and $35=5\\times7$.",
